SUMMARY:Monday office hour
DESCRIPTION:The Boston Python User Group\nUnstructured Zoom office hour! D
 rop in to ask questions\, or help people\, or just chat. Any topic or expe
 rtise level is fine!\n\nYou can add topics or questions to the #office-hou
 r Slack channel ahead of time but you don't have to: [https://bostonpython
 .slack.com/archives/C02V2C7U3D3](https://bostonpython.slack.com/archives/C
 02V2C7U3D3)\n\nEvery other Monday online at noon Eastern time.
